      "name": "Hackerteer",
      "created_at": "2026-03-21T14:36:33.450Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I am enabling the ‘<strong>Is this Tax included in Basic Rate?’</strong> option in the sales taxes and charges template in ERPNext 16 but it is not becoming the default option when this tax template is used in a sales invoice. The tax itself is being selected but the option for it to be included in basic rate is not toggled despite it being on in the Sales Taxes and Charges Template. Kindly assist</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/b/7b95dffe5a204e2d01ea76fefa6fbb7eec7b3ab4.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/7b95dffe5a204e2d01ea76fefa6fbb7eec7b3ab4\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/b/7b95dffe5a204e2d01ea76fefa6fbb7eec7b3ab4_2_690x377.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"hDhPJSZpGOWsNLrJd06mFPP5n1O\" width=\"690\" height=\"377\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/b/7b95dffe5a204e2d01ea76fefa6fbb7eec7b3ab4_2_690x377.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/b/7b95dffe5a204e2d01ea76fefa6fbb7eec7b3ab4_2_1035x565.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/b/7b95dffe5a204e2d01ea76fefa6fbb7eec7b3ab4_2_1380x754.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1566×857 48.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
