      "id": 496203,
      "username": "taylorbrooksfn",
      "name": "Taylor Brooks",
      "created_at": "2026-03-22T16:40:26.251Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think this checkbox is only being copied when the tax row is inserted, it does not always re-toggle on an invoice that already has taxes loaded.</p>\n<p>A couple of things I would test:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Remove the tax row from the Sales Invoice, then re-apply the template or use Get Taxes and Charges again.</li>\n<li>Make sure you changed the actual row inside the Sales Taxes and Charges Template, not just a copied invoice row.</li>\n<li>If this is v16 only, check whether the row type/account head combination is being recreated differently on the invoice, because that can carry the tax but miss the included-in-basic-rate flag.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>If a fresh invoice with a freshly selected template still leaves it unchecked, this feels more like a v16 bug than a setup issue.</p>",
